Description: The project root directory. This is the same path [hooks](/docs/en/hooks#reference-scripts-by-path) and MCP servers receive as CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR. Use this to reference project-local scripts or files, such as ${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.claude/hooks/helper.sh, independent of where the skill is installed.

