The empty `matcher` fires on all notification types. To fire only on specific events, set it to one of these values:

permission_prompt
Fires when: Claude needs you to approve a tool use

idle_prompt
Fires when: Claude is done and waiting for your next prompt

auth_success
Fires when: Authentication completes

elicitation_dialog
Fires when: An MCP server opens an elicitation form

elicitation_complete
Fires when: An MCP elicitation form is submitted or dismissed

elicitation_response
Fires when: An MCP elicitation response is sent back to the server

